{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56360","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 翼翼谨心二章（一章十二句，[一章□句]）（翼翼谨心，莅事也。） 一 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 翼翼谨心二章（一章十二句，[一章□句]）（翼翼谨心，莅事也。） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"克己温温，秉心翼翼。\n静以保（下缺）融，沉诵渊塞。\n言必再思，动不过则。\n（下缺）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}